# QA M3 flow (D-017, D-025, D-047): game over in Falkenstein -> continue
# restarts Falkenstein from its start. Title flow with the run started at
# Falkenstein: the solver route to the saddle's take-off, then a walk into
# the saddle cleft (death 1 at 1622, after the checkpoint); respawn at the
# checkpoint (col 114) after the stage intro; twice a walk LEFT into the
# Steinschlag cleft right beside it (deaths 2 and 3 at 1937 and 2227);
# game over at 2287. START -> the Falkenstein intro (2352) and play from
# 2502 at the Fürberg jetty (hitbox top 618 on row 40, not the
# checkpoint's 394), 3 lives, score 0, 0 Oblaten.
level  = falkenstein
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = deaths=3 event=GameOver dies_at frames=2227..2227
expect = state=playing stage=falkenstein lives=3 score=0 oblaten=0 power=normal player_y>=618 player_y<=618
